#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:7
#: 062c7fb9681649a2931d78380b638600
msgid "The most fundamental setup for any plane is the servo output functions. Each type of plane frame type will require different servo output functions to controls its motor(s) and control surfaces. Flight boards vary in the number of outputs they support,some with as few as 6 outputs and others with up to 16. Each of these outputs can be configured as needed for your airframe."
msgstr ""

